  "text": "Oncology | Veterinary Hospital Network | College of Veterinary Medicine | Mississippi State University\nSkip to main content\nSkip to main menu\nSearch Our Animal Hospitals\nToggle mobile search field\nSearch\nmyState\non Mississippi State University\nToggle mobile search field\nMenu\nHome\nStarkville Area Hospital\nJackson Area Hospital\nLarge Animal Services\nAmbulatory Services\nAnesthesia\nDiagnostic Imaging\nEmergency Services\nEquine Internal Medicine\nEquine Surgery and Sports Medicine\nLarge and Farm Animal Internal Medicine and Surgery\nOphthalmology\nPharmacy\nTheriogenology\nSmall Animal Services\n(current)\nAnesthesia\nCommunity Veterinary Services\nDentistry\nDermatology\nDiagnostic Imaging\nEmergency Services\nNeurology\nOncology\nOphthalmology\nPharmacy\nRehabilitation\nSmall Animal Internal Medicine\nSmall Animal Surgery\nTheriogenology\nGiving\nVetMed Sites\nMSState\nCalendars\nA-Z Index\nDirectory\nMaps\nNewsroom\nContact\nmyState\non Mississippi State University\nDirectory\non Mississippi State University\nSearch Our Animal Hospitals\nToggle quick search field\nSearch\nHome\nStarkville Area Hospital\nJackson Area Hospital\nLarge Animal Services\nAmbulatory Services\nAnesthesia\nDiagnostic Imaging\nEmergency Services\nEquine Internal Medicine\nEquine Surgery and Sports Medicine\nLarge and Farm Animal Internal Medicine and Surgery\nOphthalmology\nPharmacy\nTheriogenology\nSmall Animal Services\n(current)\nAnesthesia\nCommunity Veterinary Services\nDentistry\nDermatology\nDiagnostic Imaging\nEmergency Services\nNeurology\nOncology\nOphthalmology\nPharmacy\nRehabilitation\nSmall Animal Internal Medicine\nSmall Animal Surgery\nTheriogenology\nGiving\nOur Sites\nHover to scroll section menu to the left\nHover to scroll section menu to the right\nAnesthesia\nCommunity Veterinary Services\nDentistry\nDermatology\nDiagnostic Imaging\nEmergency Services\nNeurology\nOncology\n(current)\nOphthalmology\nPharmacy\nRehabilitation\nSmall Animal Internal Medicine\nSmall Animal Surgery\nTheriogenology\nOncology\nLocation\nStarkville, MS\nAnimal Size\nSmall Animal\nSpecies\nDog\n|\nCat\nOncology\nOur Oncology team provides outstanding diagnostic and therapeutic options for dogs and cats living with cancer. We provide innovative treatment for the whole patient, while offering hope and compassion with a goal of complete healing.\n662-325-1351\nReferring Vets\nOncological Services\nOncological services appointments are by referral only.\nTreatment plans are tailored to the individual needs of the patient and their families. Our experienced team of oncologic professionals provide unmatched care every step of the way.\nDiagnostic Options Include:\nfine needle aspirates/cytology\nincisional and excisional biopsies\nbone marrow sampling\nadvanced imaging such as digital radiography, ultrasonography, CT, and MRI.\nTreatment Options Include:\nSurgery\nChemotherapy\nA combination of these components\nImmunotherapy for canine melanoma\nChemotherapy is administered on site, typically on an outpatient basis.\nAppointments for new patients may be made by calling\n662-325-1351\n, or through\nreferral\nfrom your primary care veterinarian.\nThe Oncology Team\nLoading...\nAbout this service\nLocation\nStarkville, MS\nAnimal Size\nSmall Animal\nSpecies\nDog\n|\nCat\nOther clinical services …\nAnesthesia (Large)\nLarge Animal Intensive Care and Emergency Services\nOncology\nCollege of Veterinary Medicine\n240 Wise Center Drive\nP.O. Box 6100\nMississippi State, MS 39762\nCall (662) 325-3432\n(662) 325-3432",
